cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Sentamizh Corpus, please cite it as below."
title: "Sentamizh Corpus: A multi-framework annotated corpus of Classical Tamil literature"
abstract: >-
  An open-source dataset of Classical Tamil literature with a 32-field
  schema spanning Tolkappiyam-era Tamil poetics, Natya Shastra rasa theory,
  Anandavardhana's dhvani, and a cross-cultural bridge layer. Covers
  Sangam, Bhakti, Epic, and Spiritual text layers across 10,393 entries
  from 9 source texts, with provenance traced to Project Madurai, Tamil
  Virtual Academy, and Vaidehi Herbert's Sangam translations.
type: dataset
